        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Just finished listening to your review, and it was a really fun listening to you guys, however I noticed something.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>While playing cards, you only use the elements that are produced on your board and by your cards, other than things like Elemental Boon, you cannot give elements to other people.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This probably helps explain why you guys were having such an easy time winning, because allowing other people&#39;s elements to count towards your innates is insanely strong.</p>",
